,"author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Added offline fallback-chain regression coverage for throttle, timeout, and 5xx transients; targeted unit tests pass (60 passed).","timestamp":1788754899770912001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Gerrit 2738 merged with LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1; marking acceptance criteria complete before close.","timestamp":1788758724461235001}],"created_at":1788059487228341842,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"c619ebb8-f02f-4e1c-a816-b6333dcab036","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"9097-2741-6462-424c"},{"link_uuid":"b3009173-c9b3-46b3-bb8c-28b5373155dd","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"0066-3030-709c-4160"}],"description":"## Prevention remediation for incident 1c0d (CI/test lane)\n\nPost-mortem: `9097-2741-6462-424c`. This is the detection guard that would have caught the incident before prod: a contract/regression test asserting that any provider transient failure degrades to a retryable disposition, never a hard INDETERMINATE.\n\n### Problem it guards\n\nA throttled primary (429/`WAIT_AND_RETRY`) that fails over to an uncredentialed fallback surfaced as `NEEDS_INVESTIGATION` -> INDETERMINATE. The 1c0d fix (change 2404) added a held-out oracle for the specific keyless-`TypeError` case, but there is no broad contract test pinning the class invariant.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] A test drives a real `build_fallback_model` chain using mocked providers and zero live Bedrock where the primary raises retryable transients (throttle 429, timeout, and 5xx) and the terminal fallback arm raises a non-retryable credential/config error; the classified disposition is retryable (exit-11 class), never `NEEDS_INVESTIGATION`/INDETERMINATE.\n- [x] A vocabulary/closure assertion proves a `FallbackExceptionGroup` is classified by its most-recoverable leg (retryable wins), while an all-non-retryable group maps to `CHANGE_PROVIDER_OR_MODEL`, never `NEEDS_INVESTIGATION`.\n- [x] The regression oracle is mutation-sensitive to the pre-2404 class by reverting the two relevant seams locally/behind the sandbox: fallback-leg retention and fallback-group most-recoverable classification.\n- [x] The test runs in the normal `make test` matrix, with no network and no CI-provider-specific trigger.\n\n## Testing\n\nRun `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_llm_fallback_chain.py tests/unit/test_llm_failure_classifier.py` and the pre-push `make verify` gate from the ticket worktree.\n\n## Notes\n\nThis is test-only and adds no intended behavior. It complements epic 3405-c0b7's exhaustive `exception->code` contract test (same discipline, different taxonomy: this pins the `ResolutionClass` disposition, 3405 pins the workflow error-code vocabulary).","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/test_throttle_no_failover_1c0d.py","reason":"Broaden the held-out fallback-chain regression oracle across retryable transient classes."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_llm_failure_classifier.py","reason":"Referenced classifier closure coverage remains the related oracle surface."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_llm_fallback_chain.py","reason":"Related fallback-chain tests remain the construction/fallback behavior context."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","0066-3030-709c-4160"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"3e011dfd-07a5-442a-b44f-3ddd5627ea5b","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["prevention","incident-1c0d","llm","ci","regression-oracle"],"ticket_id":"d209-4968-49be-49b0","ticket_type":"task","title":"Prevention (CI/test): regression oracle — provider transient must degrade to retryable, never INDETERMINATE","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["74c5861b-ee1d-4dc3-a3a6-d7c34badda98","426089fa-6b70-4404-9d36-b4bb20812eb3","b44afea3-bde5-4a25-9662-44f6a571b58a","3e011dfd-07a5-442a-b44f-3ddd5627ea5b","20c4b127-f7b7-4669-b4a5-f598ffcb59b9","ca648e98-67c7-4017-a38c-debdac16a5e7","14f1fbda-4b12-4cb0-8e21-7d4d4be5e099","28f786e4-8b48-4df3-ab2d-55a1fd452e98","b3009173-c9b3-46b3-bb8c-28b5373155dd","3d9b809a-4cd1-4084-b099-804cde93736e","88780aaa-74e8-498f-856b-7ba4478dffa6","e4a26055-d595-45c8-9814-5bcac43e01db"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788759156916041002,"uuid":"35e9b909-9fe1-4798-8c07-0fe886cbfaeb"}